  "instance_name": "crater_as_metaphor",
  "label": "Metaphor: Crater as symbol of destruction and obliteration",
  "description": "The image of a crater is used as a metaphor for complete destruction. In the context of the meme, it represents the violent annihilation of the Middle East as the 'solution' to terrorism. This metaphor is intentionally provocative and harmful, as it equates terrorism with a physical location and suggests that the only solution is to destroy it.",
